Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.88,0:00:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那么我来说明测验规则
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.88,0:00:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,胜者的条件是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.17,0:00:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,讨伐深度8的恶魔, 魔眼狒狒王
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.89,0:00:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你们知道魔眼狒狒王吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是个会读取人心的恶魔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,外观几乎是只猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.27,0:00:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,额头上的第三只眼睛可以读取人心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.06,0:00:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,性格狡猾又残忍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.86,0:00:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,过去讨伐失败的探索者们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.07,0:00:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,在死之前都受到惨烈的拷问
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.57,0:00:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.91,0:00:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你的解说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.99,0:00:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,天翼骑士团和苍之天外
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.41,0:00:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要在这场讨伐中互相竞争
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.58,0:00:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,先击败魔眼狒狒王的队伍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.21,0:00:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,将会是这场测验的赢家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.88,0:00:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.57,0:00:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,在讨伐魔眼狒狒王之前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.42,0:00:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,也可以讨伐敌队吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.59,0:00:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们队伍主张不杀人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.01,0:00:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,而且从来不曾违背这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.72,0:00:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他的问题关乎我们队伍的核心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.31,0:00:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,请放心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.19,0:01:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们接受妨碍对手的行为
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但禁止杀人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,在对手倒下时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,就不可继续追击
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.28,0:01:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,限制行动也要选在没有恶魔的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.99,0:01:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,以上就是这次测验的规则
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.74,0:01:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,另外
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.66,0:01:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,测验时, 各位将受到我的技能监视
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.21,0:01:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不会有作弊的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.54,0:01:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就没问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.63,0:01:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,有关测验开始前的妨碍呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.63,0:01:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望规则可以订得明确一点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.29,0:01:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.59,0:01:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我前几天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.97,0:01:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,差点被他们队上的妖精暴力相向
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.43,0:01:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得自己有点危险
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.98,0:01:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定会被暗算
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.10,0:01:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,诺艾尔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.27,0:01:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那天晚上的事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.52,0:01:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.52,0:01:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你能原谅我们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.01,0:01:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我信得过你这番话?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.74,0:01:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要的很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.99,0:01:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不只要禁止测验前的任何妨碍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.58,0:01:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我要求测验当天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.74,0:02:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,两队人马都要以最佳状态到齐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.54,0:02:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,既然有这层理由
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.37,0:02:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我同意附带这些条件
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.71,0:02:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一项
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.77,0:02:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这次的测验是破例进行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不会再有第二次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.80,0:02:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,因此我希望你们也展现出各自的觉悟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.39,0:02:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,落败的人请解散队伍
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.14,0:02:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,而且今后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.52,0:02:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不许与相同的成员继续组队
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.15,0:02:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,要是违反规定
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,将被没收探索者资格
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们都同意这些条件
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.36,0:02:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,请在这里签名
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.71,0:02:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,双方在此达成协议
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.26,0:02:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,测验订在三天后的正午
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.46,0:02:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,诺艾尔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.88,0:02:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这话听起来可能很傲慢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.72,0:02:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但论实力的话是我们比较强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.51,0:03:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不过你好像拥有颠覆常识的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.89,0:03:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们绝对不会掉以轻心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.72,0:03:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,会尽全力挑战这场测验
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.27,0:03:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我就告诉你一件好事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.94,0:03:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我在前阵子提升阶级
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.82,0:03:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,已经得到新的力量了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.15,0:03:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,"战术家"的特性是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.95,0:03:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,拥有近乎预知未来的演算能力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.62,0:03:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那又怎么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.33,0:03:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我看得见喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.87,0:03:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,输掉的你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.79,0:03:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,在我面前狼狈地嚎啕大哭的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.13,0:03:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我很期待跟你们交手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.13,0:03:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,苍之天外
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.20,0:04:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,肉眼看不见 高挂心头的信念
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.53,0:04:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,将化为武器 贯穿无法应付的黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.66,0:04:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,没有什么不想输的道理
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.13,0:04:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,一切唯有变强
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,开始转动的Story
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.22,0:04:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a choice to make
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.93,0:04:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,迷惘早已舍弃在后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.39,0:04:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,只求超越深渊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.98,0:04:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm falling into the dark
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.61,0:04:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,一定会抵达 悲伤的前方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,无人知晓的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.33,0:04:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,将一切都化为力量 掌握在手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.42,0:05:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The tactics to win
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.01,0:05:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,天翼骑士团以及苍之天外的各位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.98,0:05:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴能平安迎来这一天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.19,0:05:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,现在开始
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,双方队伍即将探索深渊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.61,0:05:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,并讨伐此深渊的核心, 魔眼狒狒王
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.28,0:05:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,测验开始
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.30,0:05:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,诺艾尔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.38,0:05:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你们到底在做什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.09,0:05:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,就跟你看到的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,在吃午餐啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.01,0:05:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.47,0:05:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是一场争夺战啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.06,0:05:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,应该没有时间悠哉吃饭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.43,0:05:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,饿着肚子不能打仗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道有句话叫欲速则不达吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.65,0:05:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.78,0:06:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们让实力较强的前辈先攻
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.74,0:06:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你们先走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.03,0:06:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,胡闹也该有个…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.40,0:06:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,雷翁, 不要理他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.08,0:06:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,在我们被迫与实力差的人竞争的当下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.62,0:06:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,给主考官的印象就不是很好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.83,0:06:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,没时间慢慢来的人是我们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.42,0:06:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.00,0:06:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,诺艾尔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.05,0:06:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我对你很失望
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,先锋要来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.18,0:06:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,大约五分钟后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.35,0:06:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在这边迎击吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.90,0:06:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人准备战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,在那之前, 我能说句话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.94,0:06:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,或许我不该在这种状况下提出这个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但我想在还有余力时先谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.45,0:06:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,前几天
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.41,0:06:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,诺艾尔．修特廉有来找我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.41,0:06:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他说了一些难听的狂妄言论
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.12,0:06:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,还要求我背叛天翼骑士团
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.09,0:07:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.53,0:07:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我当然拒绝了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.55,0:07:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但那个家伙说不定…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.92,0:07:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,也对其他人做了同样的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.01,0:07:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他也有来找我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.64,0:07:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我…我当然也拒绝了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.47,0:07:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我不可能背叛大家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.14,0:07:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,其实他也有来找我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.86,0:07:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,所以诺艾尔他…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.82,0:07:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,想拉拢我以外的人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.19,0:07:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,太荒谬了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.99,0:07:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不可能背叛伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.41,0:07:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,说到底
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.62,0:07:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,什么叫做"叛徒的好处是获得自由"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.99,0:07:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,简直莫名其妙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.41,0:07:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.62,0:07:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,荒谬到连笑话都算不上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.13,0:07:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不要在意
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.34,0:07:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他的目的就是要让我们疑神疑鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.45,0:07:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,削弱我们的战力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.92,0:07:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他的手段真的是很肮脏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.93,0:07:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,能现在说清楚, 真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.81,0:07:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.64,0:07:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是天翼骑士团
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.77,0:07:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不对, 雷翁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.31,0:07:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不会背叛你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.40,0:08:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.27,0:08:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,敌人的先锋加速了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,要一鼓作气来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.54,0:08:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,"圣盾屏障"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.45,0:08:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我先称赞你真有一套吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.46,0:08:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.92,0:08:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,伪造信件实在太过火了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.50,0:08:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,赞成我这个计画的人是你耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.67,0:08:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,但我并不是同意你冒充协会之名
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.43,0:08:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那你要取消我的资格吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.27,0:08:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个人…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.27,0:08:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,真是不讨喜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.68,0:08:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢称赞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.31,0:08:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,会赢吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.78,0:08:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,会赢喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.90,0:08:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我从不灭恶鬼身上学到的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这种战斗方式
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.70,0:08:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这样真的好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.03,0:08:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,当我们在这里悠悠哉哉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.49,0:08:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,要是被天翼骑士团抢先一步…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.66,0:08:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.87,0:09:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是策略的一环
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.83,0:09:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他们很强
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.21,0:09:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,正因为这样, 我们才必须等待
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.29,0:09:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.75,0:09:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,天翼骑士团
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.30,0:09:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,雷翁在团队中也是个极其优秀的队长
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.47,0:09:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他不只战斗能力高强
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.39,0:09:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,也很擅长掌握战况
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.72,0:09:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,而且他还有一个被称为"天翼"的异能
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.35,0:09:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,魔力流动的速度天生就比别人快
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.98,0:09:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,技能发动的速度就跟思考一样迅速
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.86,0:09:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,真是上天赐予的特别才能
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.65,0:09:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.82,0:09:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,出类拔萃有时也会变成枷锁
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.87,0:09:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其以他的个性更是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.12,0:09:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.16,0:09:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他坚持确实的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.79,0:09:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还有正确的选择
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.00,0:09:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那有什么不好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.54,0:09:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他们应该很快就会证明给我们看了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.63,0:09:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,赢的会是我们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.51,0:09:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.72,0:09:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,种子已经撒下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.43,0:10:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经告诉雷翁以外的三个人…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.98,0:10:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来确切会发生的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.81,0:10:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,天翼骑士团会分崩离析
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.61,0:10:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,因为雷翁会背叛他们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.03,0:10:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,(11. 正确的代价)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.91,0:10:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底想干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.19,0:10:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你吓我也没用
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.40,0:10:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你还记得争夺战的规则吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.31,0:10:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那你是说自己不是来搞妨碍行为的?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.28,0:10:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.66,0:10:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,规则是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.49,0:10:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,当天双方伙伴需以最佳状态到齐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.08,0:10:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,又不禁止赛前友善接触
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.51,0:10:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你可不能动用暴力将我赶走喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你该不会是为此才增加那条规则吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.30,0:10:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,凯姆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.98,0:10:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,背叛天翼骑士团吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.81,0:11:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你是想笑死我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.40,0:11:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我是认真的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.98,0:11:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那背叛有什么好处?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.78,0:11:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,金钱? 地位?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.32,0:11:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,还是女人?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.93,0:11:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是自由
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.20,0:11:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我会给你自由
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.91,0:11:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,自由?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.24,0:11:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,跟着一个特别的人很辛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.92,0:11:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,雷翁身为探索者
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.54,0:11:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,确实有天赋之才
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.09,0:11:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,而且还不是普通的才能
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.30,0:11:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你身为儿时玩伴, 应该是最了解的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.26,0:11:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,天翼骑士团太扭曲了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.64,0:11:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,即使就这样成为战团
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不久之后, 你们将会跟不上雷翁的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.77,0:11:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎么努力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.06,0:11:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,依旧比不上与生俱来的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,未来只有对自己的绝望在等着你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.11,0:11:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,凯姆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.36,0:11:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,放自己自由吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.11,0:11:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就是一个好机会
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.79,0:11:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,确实如你所说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.00,0:11:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很扭曲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.08,0:12:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,即使如此我还是想支持那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.38,0:12:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是身为大哥的责任
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.13,0:12:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的甘愿这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.42,0:12:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我的愿望才不是什么自由
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.72,0:12:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不背叛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.18,0:12:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那先背叛的人…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.89,0:12:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,就是雷翁了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.07,0:12:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,凯姆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.73,0:12:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,伏拉卡夫就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.86,0:12:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.69,0:12:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.99,0:12:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,奥菲莉亚, 你来支援
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.32,0:12:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,玩具…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.20,0:12:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,有好多玩具可以玩可以粉碎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.41,0:12:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,和魔眼狒狒王开始战斗后
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.33,0:12:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,已经过了一个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.08,0:12:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然眷属已经除掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.09,0:12:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,战况却很明显对我们不利
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.63,0:12:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,炎精招来(Phlogiston)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.74,0:12:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,被看穿了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.85,0:12:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,没用
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,读取人心的魔猿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.68,0:13:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,偷袭也没用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.66,0:13:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但是只要有我的天翼…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.32,0:13:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,"神圣波动"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.74,0:13:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.66,0:13:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,大家, 快点躲开
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.54,0:13:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,诺艾尔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.58,0:13:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们再不行动没关系吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.67,0:13:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不要着急
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.80,0:13:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,等他们用尽全力, 看清自己的极限
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.92,0:13:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,在那之前都待命
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.95,0:13:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,奥菲莉亚!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.11,0:13:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,玩具, 破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.82,0:13:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,一点一点破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.53,0:13:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.99,0:13:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,全员撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.70,0:13:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我负责殿后
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.74,0:13:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,"圣盾屏障"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.99,0:14:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,"钢之意志"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.41,0:14:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,玩具好强
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.29,0:14:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但其实强的只有你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.63,0:14:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.63,0:14:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,恐惧和不安
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.84,0:14:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,真是低级的挑衅啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.72,0:14:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,终究是只猴子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.05,0:14:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,逞强也没用
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.30,0:14:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你的心说着我们赢不了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.39,0:14:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.43,0:14:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,现在赢不了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.77,0:14:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但是探索者绝对不会放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.31,0:14:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,就算输了一次, 也一定会获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.90,0:14:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,"绝对防御"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.66,0:14:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.00,0:14:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,动得了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.42,0:14:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,手已经有知觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.79,0:14:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,但可能没办法拉弓
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.96,0:14:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,雷翁, 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.46,0:14:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你不要在意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.05,0:14:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们又还没输
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.35,0:15:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,各位…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.87,0:15:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.31,0:15:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我有一个计画
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.64,0:15:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我来当诱饵引诱它
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.02,0:15:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,等它上钩的瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.23,0:15:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你就使出"骑士"最强技能
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.98,0:15:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,"日轮极光"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.90,0:15:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.73,0:15:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,太危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.11,0:15:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为发出一击就会耗掉你全部的魔力吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.61,0:15:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.37,0:15:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是攻击范围太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.99,0:15:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,会波及到你们
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.87,0:15:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才要我这个诱饵啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.12,0:15:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,伏拉卡夫设下的这个结界
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.25,0:15:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,会隔绝我们与恶魔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.54,0:15:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,可是一旦发动强悍的攻击技能
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.71,0:15:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,结界就会被攻击余波毁坏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.84,0:15:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没办法从这里突袭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.68,0:15:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,就算这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.80,0:15:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,雷翁, 快回想起那个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.35,0:15:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们声名大噪的森林邪龙之战
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.62,0:16:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我来当诱饵
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.31,0:16:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,尽可能将它引到远处
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.87,0:16:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.64,0:16:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我又不是要自杀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我会跟那个时候一样, 成功逃给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.87,0:16:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.21,0:16:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,雷翁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.01,0:16:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.47,0:16:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,现在的状况和当时不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.01,0:16:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,魔眼狒狒王会读取人心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.26,0:16:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,它很快就会看穿你是诱饵
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.35,0:16:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那你说该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.02,0:16:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,要是撤退, 我们就会失去资格
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.81,0:16:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,天翼骑士团会解散
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.69,0:16:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也会分崩离析
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.52,0:16:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,有一个…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.61,0:16:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我有一个计画
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.98,0:16:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们和苍之天外会合吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.86,0:16:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,只要和他们合作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.41,0:16:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,就能讨伐魔眼狒狒王
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.87,0:16:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不用牺牲任何人也能战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.04,0:16:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,等…等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.37,0:16:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这样子测验会变成什么样子?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.87,0:16:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.51,0:16:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,放弃测验吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.50,0:16:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,只要跟他们一同战斗, 完成这个任务
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.51,0:17:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,就算协会拒绝我们创立战团
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.59,0:17:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,应该也能避免队伍遭到解散
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.10,0:17:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不背叛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.10,0:17:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,先背叛的人就是雷翁了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.77,0:17:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.98,0:17:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然跟那家伙说的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.02,0:17:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙说的话是这个意思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.90,0:17:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.82,0:17:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你是认真的吗, 雷翁
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.44,0:17:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,苍之天外…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可是敌人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.53,0:17:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是我们应该打败的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.03,0:17:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你居然…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.83,0:17:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,否则我们还能怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.62,0:17:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不牺牲任何一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.16,0:17:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,以队长的身分守护大家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.12,0:17:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这是最正确的选择
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.50,0:17:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你总是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.46,0:17:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,正不正确在这种情况下根本…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.96,0:17:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,凯姆, 你冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.01,0:17:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.59,0:17:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这不像你…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.09,0:17:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我很冷静\N这不像你…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.68,0:17:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我很冷静地思考我们的事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.85,0:17:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.33,0:17:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不相信我, 而是相信敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.27,0:17:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你更相信诺艾尔．修特廉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.82,0:18:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.19,0:18:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你相比
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.53,0:18:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我更相信诺艾尔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.07,0:18:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.95,0:18:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你的回答吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.13,0:18:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙是对的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.29,0:18:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,叛徒…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.59,0:18:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.76,0:18:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.34,0:18:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我避开了要害
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.18,0:18:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,凯姆…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.31,0:18:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,雷翁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.56,0:18:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直很嫉妒你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.63,0:18:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我恨你拥有我没有的才能
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.90,0:18:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但你是我的小弟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.86,0:18:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.53,0:18:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你信任我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.62,0:18:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我才能坚持到现在
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.16,0:18:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是为了你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.29,0:18:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就算会失去生命…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.58,0:18:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.67,0:19:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我已经不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.80,0:19:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我撑不下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.80,0:19:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.72,0:19:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,想获得自由
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.30,0:19:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.39,0:19:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,天翼骑士团的各位
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.73,0:19:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦你们当开路先锋了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,玩具玩具…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.94,0:19:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,新的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.83,0:19:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,初次见面, 魔眼狒狒王
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.07,0:19:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我是诺艾尔．修特廉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.11,0:19:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,诺艾尔…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.90,0:19:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.26,0:19:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,真可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.54,0:19:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会成为你的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.37,0:19:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,来互相残杀吧, 泼猴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.92,0:19:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,昊牙, 动手!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.09,0:19:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.01,0:19:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你们为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.64,0:19:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,就照着训练来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.52,0:20:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,"明镜止水"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.61,0:20:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.73,0:20:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,攻击和思考同时到来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.82,0:20:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,与思考同步发动技能的异能
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.24,0:20:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,能使用天翼的只有雷翁
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.66,0:20:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我们利用"思考共有"来训练
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.25,0:20:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,学会了接近天翼状态的全神贯注攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.59,0:20:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,灵髓弹
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.03,0:20:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,真不愧是一发一千万菲尔的魔法子弹
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.19,0:20:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你…为什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.76,0:20:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,明明有在思考
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.85,0:20:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,却读不到你的心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.85,0:20:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,"战术家"的超高速思考
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.31,0:20:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,远远超过魔眼狒狒王能读取的范围
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.94,0:20:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,思考太快, 导致无法判读情报
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.42,0:20:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,看来变成玩具的人是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.29,0:20:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了你…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.79,0:21:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了你!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.51,0:21:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,昊牙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.25,0:21:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,"樱花狂咲"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.71,0:21:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就看穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.43,0:21:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,思考太多, 脑袋快爆了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.60,0:21:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我把高速思考转换成高速分割思考
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.06,0:21:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,对于能读取人心的你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.81,0:21:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,想必非常吵吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.32,0:21:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不能原谅你…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.74,0:21:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我不原谅你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.00,0:21:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这…这样我的脑袋就不会痛了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.21,0:21:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,去死
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.21,0:21:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,指令
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.42,0:21:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,亚儿玛, 刺死他
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.94,0:21:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.72,0:21:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,"速度提升"十二倍速
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.53,0:22:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you understand my word
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.79,0:22:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear my voice telling you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.00,0:22:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you join to fight with me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.22,0:22:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you get what it means
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.47,0:22:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I see all crystal clear
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.23,0:22:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Among all tangled strings
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.81,0:22:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to treat it as cold as
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.44,0:22:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Threads with cold blood
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.57,0:22:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of taking sugarcoated
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.11,0:23:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Pills to make you eased
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.49,0:23:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I directly talk inside your head
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.70,0:23:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,To make you strong
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.71,0:23:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause i see it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.84,0:23:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We can break
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.97,0:23:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The old empire
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.14,0:23:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,With our powers
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.14,0:23:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it over
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.27,0:23:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,In near future
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.35,0:23:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,with no fear
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.04,0:23:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,(12. 那条蛇长出了翅膀)
